tar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nIt appears to be impossible to jit a function that gets a sharded input array to the host, calls a function via  \n`jax.pure_callback`, and then puts it back to the original sharding, as illustrated in the examples below.\n\nWithout jit, `jnp_func` successfully implements the desired operations:\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax.sharding import AxisType, NamedSharding, SingleDeviceSharding\nfrom jax.sharding import PartitionSpec as P\n\ndef np_func(x):\n    x = np.array(x)\n    x[::2] = 0.0\n    return x\n\nnum_dev = jax.device_count()\nmesh = jax.make_mesh(\n    (num_dev,),\n    (\"a\",),\n    axis_types=(AxisType.Auto,),\n)\nshard = NamedSharding(mesh, P(\"a\"))\n\nx = jnp.ones((num_dev, 64, 64), dtype=np.float32, device=shard)\n\ndef jnp_func(x):\n    y = jax.pure_callback(\n        np_func,\n        jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(x.shape, x.dtype),\n        jax.device_put(x, device=jax.devices(\"cpu\")[0]),\n        sharding=SingleDeviceSharding(jax.devices(\"cpu\")[0]),\n    )\n    return jax.device_put(y, device=x.sharding)\n\ny = jnp_func(x)\n```\nbut a jitted version fails:\n```python\n\n@jax.jit\ndef jnp_func_jit(x):\n    y = jax.pure_callback(\n        np_func,\n        jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(x.shape, x.dtype),\n        jax.device_put(x, device=jax.devices(\"cpu\")[0]),\n        sharding=SingleDeviceSharding(jax.devices(\"cpu\")[0]),\n    )\n    return jax.device_put(y, device=jax.typeof(x).sharding)\n\ny = jnp_func_jit(x)\n```\n\nThe error is\n```python\nFile miniconda3/envs/py312g/lib/python3.12/site-packages/jax/_src/callback.py:190, in _callback_op_sharding(axis_context, sharding, avals_out)\n    187   raise AssertionError(\n    188       \"Please file a bug at https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues\")\n    189 try:\n--> 190   device_index = device_assignment.index(device)\n    191 except IndexError as e:\n    192   raise ValueError(\n    193       \"Sharding provided to pure_callback specifies a device\"\n    194       f\" {device} that is not in the device assignment\"\n    195       f\" ({device_assignment})\") from e\n\nValueError: tuple.index(x): x not in tuple\n```\n\nNote that the exception is not caught as intended because a `ValueError` rather than an `IndexError` is raised. \n\nIt's less clear whether an error is actually required here. If so, the broader issue would be one of inadequate documentation rather than a bug: what is the device assignment, and how can the usage be modified so that sharded arrays on devices are properly handled (in particular, so that the result is returned directly from the host to the device sharding without going via an array on a single device)?\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.10.1\njaxlib: 0.10.1\nnumpy:  2.2.6\npython: 3.12.2 | packaged by conda-forge | (main, Feb 16 2024, 20:50:58) [GCC 12.3.0]\ndevice info: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti-8, 8 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='host', release='6.8.0-117-generic', version='#117~22.04.1-Ubuntu SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu May  7 22:17:46 UTC ', machine='x86_64')\n\n$ nvidia-smi\nWed Jun  3 12:06:50 2026       \n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| NVIDIA-SMI 580.105.08             Driver Version: 580.105.08     CUDA Version: 13.0     |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id          Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\n| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |           Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\n|                                         |                        |               MIG M. |\n|=========================================+========================+======================|\n|   0  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti     Off |   00000000:1A:00.0 Off |                  N/A |\n| 30%   24C    P8             12W /  250W |    8378MiB /  11264MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |                  N/A |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n...\n```\n","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38164/comments","created_at":"2026-06-03T18:26:26Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38164/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/38164","id":4582571745,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38164/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABESR-4Q","number":38164,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38164/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38164/timeline","title":"Error using `jax.pure_callback` with sharded arrays","type":null,"updated_at":"2026-06-03T22:47:35Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38164","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11278668?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwohlberg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwohlberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bwohlberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.git